  machine: arm64 / Darwin
  ONNX Runtime's CPU kernels are tuned for x86-64 Linux servers, which is
  where a voice agent actually runs. On Apple Silicon (ARM) PyTorch uses
  Apple's own tuned BLAS and can beat ORT. The int8-vs-fp32 RATIO is the
  portable result (3-4x, 4x smaller); the absolute ranking of backends is
  hardware-specific. Re-run this on the deployment target before quoting it.

